    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. regarding the signage, i'm worried it might look a bit too clinical or 'emergency' like if we just have big warning signs everywhere. is there a more elegant way to handle the labeling so it feels high-end for a law firm gala but still keeps the allergy info extremely clear? maybe something more integrated into the menu design?",
